    "number": 60,
    "summary": "David says that the Lord has scattered His people—The Lord places Ephraim at the head and makes Judah His lawgiver.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "O God, thou hast cast us off, thou hast scattered us, thou hast been displeased; O turn thyself to us again.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 49,
            "text": "1 Ne. 10:14; 2 Ne. 25:15 (14–18); D&C 101:13."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 60:1",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 60,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast made the earth to tremble; thou hast broken it: heal the breaches thereof; for it shaketh.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 60:2",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 60,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast shewed thy people hard things: thou hast made us to drink the wine of astonishment.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 80,
            "end": 92,
            "text": "HEB staggering."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 60:3",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 60,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast given a banner to them that fear thee, that it may be displayed because of the truth. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "2 Ne. 29:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "2 Ne. 29:2.",
            "prettyString": "2 Nephi 29:2",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "2nephi",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 29,
                    "end": 29,
                    "verses": [
                      {
